"User Content" means music, audio recordings, performances, compositions,
sound design, audiovisual works, games, broadcasts, streams, and user-created
presets produced through normal use of the Software. User Content does not
include the Software, Modified Software, source code, or original project
assets themselves.

"Commercial Software Activity" means selling, licensing, renting, charging
for access to, commercially distributing, or otherwise receiving direct or
